\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Live escalation on the internal test set (speakable subset, $n{=}218$). Blue: deployed-channel accuracy, where the expert answers from the talker's own transcript. Green: the same sessions re-scored with the expert answering the reference transcript, which factors out the relay channel. Each curve has its own matched-rate random reference (dashed, same floor and endpoint). Selection beats random in both, by 7.2--9.4 points deployed and 5.3--8.3 points channel-controlled; the gap between the curves is the cost of the relay channel.}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dualview}{{3}{8}{Live escalation on the internal test set (speakable subset, $n{=}218$). Blue: deployed-channel accuracy, where the expert answers from the talker's own transcript. Green: the same sessions re-scored with the expert answering the reference transcript, which factors out the relay channel. Each curve has its own matched-rate random reference (dashed, same floor and endpoint). Selection beats random in both, by 7.2--9.4 points deployed and 5.3--8.3 points channel-controlled; the gap between the curves is the cost of the relay channel}{figure.3}{}}
